C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Jx3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57cb5a2c-a438-4832-bf19-d624f2beba54","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/seethrough.vim\u003e","ts":"1626251429.063800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"lambdalisue/seethrough.vim","id":1,"title":"lambdalisue/seethrough.vim","text":"Make Vim transparent","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"5","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4cZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6150e794-9c17-4240-b1bd-6a396e940599","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"lそれなら普通に動きそうですけどねえ...","ts":"1626251239.062500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pv9Dk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a0e2c6a-a882-450d-aa98-ac3d1ed3a1b8","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"\u0026gt; タイミング\n設定タイミングとしてはvimEnterのイベントで設定してます\n```hook_add = \"\"\"\nfunction! DefineHighlights()\n    if g:colors_name is \"night-owl\"\n        highlight Normal ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE\n        highlight NonText ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE\n        highlight LineNr ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE\n        highlight Folded ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE\n        highlight EndOfBuffer ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE\n     endif\nendfunction\n\naugroup colorcshemeSetting\n    autocmd!\n    autocmd VimEnter * nested colorscheme night-owl\n    autocmd ColorScheme * :call DefineHighlights()\naugroup END```","ts":"1626251203.062100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zH1me"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb09c118-2f29-46c5-a817-8ba777f910c1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"設定したタイミングの問題....かな?\nやってれば効きそうなんだけどな...","ts":"1626251056.060100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i7TlO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8cecbd22-f5ca-4605-8a72-02c420a71875","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"```        highlight Normal ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE\n        highlight NonText ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE\n        highlight LineNr ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE\n        highlight Folded ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE\n        highlight EndOfBuffer ctermbg=NONE guibg=NONE```\nいまはこんな感じに設定しています","ts":"1626251020.059500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3vU1K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4387c622-45ef-460a-9b6d-39e28694e2da","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"こんなん\n\u003chttps://github.com/tsuyoshicho/transparency.vim/blob/c05687df630b6f8932b4976a5ecb3c289f0aedbe/plugin/transparency.vim#L94-L102\u003e","ts":"1626250989.058900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/tsuyoshicho/transparency.vim/blob/c05687df630b6f8932b4976a5ecb3c289f0aedbe/plugin/transparency.vim | transparency.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/tsuyoshicho/transparency.vim/blob/c05687df630b6f8932b4976a5ecb3c289f0aedbe/plugin/transparency.vim | transparency.vim\u003e","text":"```\n  function! s:termtrans_set() abort\n    highlight Normal       ctermbg=NONE\n    highlight NonText      ctermbg=NONE\n    highlight EndOfBuffer  ctermbg=NONE\n    highlight Folded       ctermbg=NONE\n    highlight LineNr       ctermbg=NONE\n    highlight CursorLineNr ctermbg=NONE\n    highlight SpecialKey   ctermbg=NONE\n  endfunction\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/tsuyoshicho/transparency.vim|tsuyoshicho/transparency.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2hzLi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"412f735c-1a9a-4987-8871-e5ce71b9adfa","type":"message","user":"UAZ3