A1UBE","text":"プラグインマネージャー自身は手順にしたがって入れる必要がありますが、入れてしまえば `Plug 'puremourning/vimspector'` (vim-plugの文法) みたいな1行をvimrcに追加するだけでインストールできるようになります。","ts":"1626253268.068600","thread_ts":"1626219254.038100","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p6ll"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a80f775b-cea2-4f70-8518-ddefb1b4b684","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"マネージャーもたくさん種類がありますが、海外だと vim-plug が有名どころ。\nvim-jp では Shougo さん作の dein.vim 使ってる人も多いです。","ts":"1626253383.068800","thread_ts":"1626219254.038100","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9gW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8204efe1-648e-47bd-928f-ba21743c73ac","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/junegunn/vim-plug\u003e\n\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim\u003e","ts":"1626253400.069000","thread_ts":"1626219254.038100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"junegunn/vim-plug","id":1,"title":"junegunn/vim-plug","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"23961","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null},{"color":"24292f","fallback":"Shougo/dein.vim","id":2,"title":"Shougo/dein.vim","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"3003","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"91H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66c38b9e-25d4-490e-aa53-1891f6b34113","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"kuuさんに教えてもらったこれなんですが、\nautocmd BufRead *.yaml if getline(1) =~# \"AWSTemplateFormatVersion\" | set ft=cl  oudformation.yaml | endif\n\\*.ymlにも同じ設定をしようと思うと、\\*.yamlのとこだけ変えて一文全部コピる形になります？","ts":"1626189092.031800","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1626189110.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ov9nK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a66709b1-3cf2-40b5-832c-8ce5eaa90949","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"割と確認する機会はある、拡張子からファイルタイプ名推測できないし","ts":"1626189087.031500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SsjA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d6e1ebe-e9dc-4a81-8dc8-a52f71c17ee1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"やっぱり現在のfiletypeは重要ですよね笑 :set ft、なるほどー!","ts":"1626189022.030900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8RE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"644c9034-b165-4991-a304-f7563ab96d1e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`set ft` `echo \u0026amp;ft` めっちゃ使う(主に vim-lsp-setting をいじってる時)w","ts":"1626188975.030700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tFZ6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f37d4f4d-a941-4a68-a87a-fc82ec5b9dcc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"後はstatuslineに出しておくとか","ts":"1626188937.030000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gQC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"002796eb-2348-4d2a-8eeb-bbd6c8694db3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`:set ft` が一番楽かな","ts":"1626188922.029700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B8CRI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97f20ccf-2b01-4df8-b6d0-3086a6e654bc","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"これって現在のバッファ?のfiletypeってどうやって確認するんでしょうか？","ts":"1626188885.029100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w9wV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"370dc98a-e001-4765-98ba-59369197c033","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"おー! lspでのエラー表示がなくなりました! ありがとうございます!","ts":"1626188855.028800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GYgZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fad503b-c928-42e1-98b6-a555913a2feb","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ちなみに vim-lsp-settings の yaml-language-server の設定はここです\n```\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/blob/609c40d4947c762bbe9009b8bcd89e2c83be1dad/settings/yaml-language-server.vim#L9\u003e```\n","ts":"1626188855.028700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m/j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54b3d31e-5316-4aea-ad70-e9b7c4c74a0a","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"辞書で初期化してくださいませ\n```let g:lsp_settings = {}```","ts":"1626188779.028200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YFd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"271d1fe9-eb73-4315-83ef-81cc9576a669","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"E121: Undefined variable: g:lsp_settings\nになってしまいました。。空配列で初期化が必要ですか？","ts":"1626188706.027800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4MU0"}]}]
